            "id": 80361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza il valore restituito nella console chiamando la funzione con il valore <code>\"Jo\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sign_up\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(user)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  status = user + \" /><text value=\"&quot; signed up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sign_up(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"86\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Jo signed up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>sign_up(\"Jo\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
