            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione e passale un valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_area\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  width = \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" width * height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rectangle area: \" /><text value=\"{get_area(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rectangle area: 2600\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get_area</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>100</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione all'interno della f-string e passale un valore in modo che il codice stampi <code>Rectangle area: 2600</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_area\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  width = \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" width * height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rectangle area: \" /><text value=\"{get_area(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"height\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rectangle area: 2600\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get_area</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>100</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
