            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"retrieve_score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(retrieve_score())\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100 + 100</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non visualizzerà nulla nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché la console mostra <code>200</code> invece di <code>100 + 100</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"retrieve_score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(retrieve_score())\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La funzione valuta l'addizione, restituisce <code>200</code> e <code>print()</code> lo visualizza.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La funzione restituisce i caratteri <code>100 + 100</code> senza valutarli.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un valore restituito non può essere usato all'interno di <code>print()</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La funzione valuta l'addizione, restituisce <code>200</code> e <code>print()</code> lo visualizza.</p></body></html>"
